    affiliation: "Faculty of Medical Technology, Van Lang University, Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
abstract: "Browser-based Monte Carlo simulator of the probability that colistin, meropenem and ampicillin/sulbactam (three pairs and the triple combination) reach their own target concentrations in the same virtual patient, using measured checkerboard concentrations from 39 carbapenem-resistant Acinetobacter baumannii isolates and published population pharmacokinetic models. Research use only."
keywords:
  - Acinetobacter baumannii
  - colistin
  - meropenem
  - ampicillin/sulbactam
  - pharmacokinetics/pharmacodynamics
  - Monte Carlo simulation
